:: UserScript [script]
window.fixtureToken = "chapbook-fixture-v1";

:: Start
hasKey: false
--
You stand before a heavy oak door.
[[Search the floor->Search]]
[[Try the handle->Try Handle]]

:: Search
hasKey: true
--
A small iron key glints among the leaves.
[[Take it and try the door->Try Handle]]

:: Try Handle
[if hasKey]
The key turns smoothly. The door swings open.
[[Step inside->Cellar]]
[else]
The handle won't budge.
[[Search the floor->Search]]
[continue]

:: Cellar [ending]
A cool cellar greets you. The end.
